@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Consultar manual local
actor Usuário as U
participant NavigationTabs as NAV
participant App
participant ManualScreen as Manual
U -> NAV: onOpenManual()
NAV -> App: setScreen(manual)
App -> Manual: ManualScreen()
Manual --> U: Tópicos de utilização
@enduml
